// Dialog :
"P1128720346" "Thank you very much for recovering that data. It might have been very damaging had any of it leaked out. Crey Industries is always willing to assist local governments when it helps all involved, but sometimes we must take pains to make certain that governments do not interfere with our company goals. <br><br>I hope you didn't waste your time trying to sift through all of this. I appreciate the desire to be of further assistance to Crey Industries, but that's a bit outside your contract. Speaking of which, this information has shed light on some follow-up work I could use assistance on. Let me get things arranged for you. One moment, please."
// RandomFameString :
"P2277027830" "{VillainName} annihilated a Longbow base. I almost feel sorry for them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1583014366" "I've had some people examine the data you acquired and it has presented us with an interesting opportunity or two. It seems that Longbow has acquired a piece of Rikti technology, and they plan to analyze it. Doing so might reveal certain technical secrets Crey Industries would prefer to keep a monopoly on, or even worse, eventually lead to heroes acquiring this technology. I would like you to remove this threat to Crey's technical leadership by destroying the captured device and all the evidence of it."
// AcceptString :
"P379177796" "Destroy the device and all evidence."
// SendOffString :
"P2715683773" "There are several things you'll need to do. First off, as much as we would like to recover this particular item for our own use, it's already known to Longbow, so moving it may arouse suspicions. So you should simply destroy it. I also need you to recover any analysis of the device that Longbow may have completed. And finally, you will also need to liquidate everyone in the Longbow facility to make certain that no information about the device gets out. I know you can handle all of that, and have the utmost confidence in you. <br><br>And {VillainName}? <br>Thank you."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1789984826" "Sanitize Longbow Lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1708513614" "You have three things to do: Destroy the captured device, recover the data Longbow's gotten from it, and liquidate all personnel."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P437020894" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two</color>"

